      "text": "Area of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>S</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>12</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "Radius of incircle of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "Length of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>O</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": true
